;margin:0 auto;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:6px 12px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:8px;border-radius:6px;background:var(--brand-light)\">\n          <img src=\"/assets/avatar-fox.png\" style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:50%\" alt=\"\">\n          <div style=\"flex:1;font-size:12px\"><b>New reply</b> has been added to the list and the changes are marked with a short entry animation</div>\n          <span class=\"demo-tag blue\">New</span>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:8px\">\n          <img src=\"/assets/avatar-robot.png\" style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:50%\" alt=\"\">\n          <div style=\"flex:1;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\"><b>Robot Assistant</b> liked your article</div>\n          <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">1 hour ago</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:6px;margin-top:8px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">\n        Background highlight flashes once\n        <span style=\"width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:3px;background:var(--brand-light)\"></span>→\n        <span style=\"width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:3px;background:var(--brand-light);opacity:.5\"></span>→\n        <span style=\"width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:3px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border)\"></span>\n        Stop at the last frame, no loop\n      </div>\n    </div>"],"variants":[{"demo":"<span class=\"anim-v-track\"><i class=\"anim-v-ball\" style=\"left:78%\"></i></span>","when":"Entry arrangement, stop at the last frame after playing"},{"demo":"<span class=\"anim-v-loop\">⟳</span>","when":"Continuous states such as loading and breathing"},{"demo":"<span class=\"anim-v-track\"><i class=\"anim-v-ball\" style=\"left:38%\"></i><span class=\"anim-v-arr\">↔</span></span>","when":"Reciprocating motions such as swinging and flashing"}]},"usageMocks":{"pg-loading":"<div class=\"mk-row \"><span class=\"mk-spinner\"></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">加载中，请稍候…</span></div>","anim-keyframes":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"width:100%\"><span class=\"mk-tag blue\">0%</span><span style=\"flex:1;height:2px;background:var(--border)\"></span><span class=\"mk-tag blue\">50%</span><span style=\"flex:1;height:2px;background:var(--border)\"></span><span class=\"mk-tag blue\">100%</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">把动作拆成关键帧，浏览器补齐中间</span></div>","anim-sequence":"<div class=\"mk-row\"><span style=\"width:26px;height:18px;background:var(--brand-light);border:1px solid var(--brand);border-radius:3px;font-size:12px;color:var(--brand);display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">1</span><span style=\"width:26px;height:18px;background:var(--brand-light);border:1px solid var(--brand);border-radius:3px;font-size:12px;color:var(--brand);display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;opacity:.65\">2</span><span style=\"width:26px;height:18px;background:var(--brand-light);border:1px solid var(--brand);border-radius:3px;font-size:12px;color:var(--brand);display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;opacity:.35\">3</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">多元素依次入场，用 delay 编排</span>","anim-vs-trans":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"width:100%\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);width:44px\">悬停变色</span><span class=\"mk-tag blue\">transition</span></div><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"width:100%\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);width:44px\">加载呼吸</span><span class=\"mk-tag orange\">animation</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">状态切换 vs 自主播放，各司其职</span></div>","anim-loop":"<div class=\"mk-row\"><span class=\"mk-spinner\"></span><span class=\"mk-spinner\"></span><span class=\"mk-spinner\"></span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">过多循环动画会分散注意力</span>","anim-overkill":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\"><span class=\"mk-btn primary\" style=\"font-size:12px\">悬停变色</span><span class=\"mk-tag red\">@keyframes</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">简单 hover 可使用 transition</span></div>","anim-fillmode":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"width:100%\"><span style=\"width:16px;height:12px;background:var(--brand);border-radius:2px;opacity:.3\"></span><span style=\"width:16px;height:12px;background:var(--brand);border-radius:2px;opacity:.7\"></span><span style=\"width:16px;height:12px;background:var(--brand);border-radius:2px\"></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">↩</span><span style=\"width:16px;height:12px;background:#e5e6eb;border-radius:2px\"></span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">未设置 fill-mode: forwards，结束后回到初始帧</span></div>","anim-motion":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row between\" style=\"width:100%\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">减弱动态效果</span><span class=\"mk-switch on\"><i></i></span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">应响应用户的减弱动态效果偏好</span></div>"}}}